{{ img:units/Plane Factory.png|Plane Factory}}
=Plane Factory=
*  Health: 40
*  Price: %Minerals% 200
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 2
*  Consumes: %Fuel%20 %Minerals%20
Plane factories produce planes

Putting a plane factory to [[controls|sleep]] switches it off. Sleep is persistent: queuing new planes does not wake the factory up. Production starts once you wake it again.
